-        "\n"
-        "/* The lines PₚᵣₑᵥP₀ and P₀Pₙₑₓₜ, both offset by ±½w, intersect each other at:\n"
-        " *\n"
-        " *   Pᵢ = P₀ ± w · ½q⃑ᵢ.\n"
-        " *\n"
-        " * Where:\n"
-        " *\n"
-        " *   q⃑ᵢ = q̂ₚᵣₑᵥ⊥ + tan(½θ) · -q̂ₚᵣₑᵥ\n"
